ared 401 or 403, as applicable, and no undeclared role rule denies an otherwise authorized request.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls that operation.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-1\",\n  \"given\": \"The API host is running.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-1.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 404 for an undefined path or 405 for an unsupported method, and no feedlot product screen is displayed.\",\n  \"when\": \"A client requests an undefined path such as /yard, or uses an unsupported method for a contract path such as POST /dashboard.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has valid sign-in credentials and no bearer token.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the contract-defined accessToken and user fields, including declared permissions and authorizedYards.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /auth/sign-in with the contract SignInRequest body.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response user field contains the current user and contract-defined permissions.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /session.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"Authorized dashboard data and a valid rankBy value of fcr, adg, or costOfGain are available.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rankingMeasure, bestLots, and worstLots correspond to the selected measure.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /dashboard with the selected rankBy value.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"Lots have distinct pen, breed, sex, and status values and the client has a valid bearer token.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response lots list contains only rows matching the s