n allocation quantities.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"Both response statuses are 200 and the response poLines, lotPens, and pens contain the saved quantities, traceability status, and capacity information.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls PUT /allocations and then GET /allocations.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-3\",\n  \"given\": \"A client submits an invalid selection, conflicting import, or allocation that violates saved state.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-3.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status and error response match the operation's declared 409 or 422 contract.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client submits the relevant import or allocation request.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the lot forecast values, forecastBasis, and effective yard and lot assumptions.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/forecast.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ForecastSettingsRequest.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains persisted setting values; a subsequent forecast response contains the effective assumptions and projectedMarketDate declared by the contract.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends PATCH /forecast-settings or PATCH /lots/{lotId}/forecast-settings for an existing lot.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested lot exists with feeding and weight records where applicable.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains contract-defined metrics or suggestions with their basis, including null unavailable metric values where applicable.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /lots/{lotId}/metrics or GET /lots/{lotId}/insights.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing lot, and a valid planner-selected insight action or WeightMeasurementRequest.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status and response fields match the contract, and the returned action or measurement is present in the subsequent relevant response.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /lots/{lotId}/insights/actions, GET /lots/{lotId}/weights, or POST /lots/{lotId}/weights as applicable.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-4\",\n  \"given\": \"A client submits a weight measurement that fails contract validation, or requests forecast data or settings for a nonexistent lot.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-4.5\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is the contract-declared 422 with VALIDATION_ERROR for invalid measurement data or 404 with NOT_FOUND for a nonexistent lot.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends the applicable weight, forecast, or forecast-settings request.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and inventory items or movements exist, or the inventory is empty.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains operationalTotals, items, movements, and contract-defined stock fields.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid InventoryItemRequest for creation or update.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for update and the response item contains the saved contract fields and stock values.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/items or PATCH /inventory/items/{itemId}.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid receipt or adjustment InventoryMovementRequest for an existing item.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response contains the saved movement and item with updated stock values.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /inventory/movements.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, a supported horizon, and inventory with applicable plans and wastage settings.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the selected horizon, projection rows with projected consumption and balance, and movement distinctions.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory/projections separately for daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, semiAnnual, and annual horizons.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits an inventory request that fails contract validation or a projection horizon outside the contract enum.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.5\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 422 and the response error code is VALIDATION_ERROR.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends the applicable inventory write or projection request.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-5\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and authorized operational inventory rows exist.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-5.6\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains fileName, contentType text/csv, and a Base64 CSV file derived from operational records.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /inventory/export.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and saved ration definitions exist, or the ration collection is empty.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response rations list contains saved ingredient, proportion, nutrition, cost, and approval fields.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /rations.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid RationRequest for creation or revision.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 for creation or 200 for revision and the response ration contains the persisted definition and calculated contract fields, including costPerPound where declared.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /rations or PATCH /rations/{rationId}.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid ration optimization request with candidate mixes and nutrition requirements.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the contract optimization result and cost comparison, including the lowest-cost qualifying candidate or qualifyingMixFound=false as applicable.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /rations/optimization.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-6\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and the requested ration exists in a state eligible for approval.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-6.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response contains the rationId and updated approvalStatus, which is Approved where specified by the contract.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /rations/{rationId}/approval.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and saved feed plans exist, or the plan collection is empty.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response plans list contains saved plan details, execution state, and audit-related fields.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /feed-plans.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedPlanRequest with dated pen, ration, bunk rate, and animal-count values.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response plan contains calculated planned quantity, quantity per animal, total feed cost, expected energy intake, and status fields.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /feed-plans.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-7\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing plan, and a valid PlanReviewRequest or PlanStatusRequest.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-7.3\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response plan contains the saved reviewRequired value or requested execution status.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /feed-plans/{planId}/review or PATCH /feed-plans/{planId}/status.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and saved feeding events and lot allocations exist, or the event collection is empty.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.1\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response events list contains saved activity, lot allocations, and inventory movements.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends GET /feeding-events.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token and submits a valid FeedingEventRequest with planned and delivered quantities.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-8.2\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the response contains the saved event, variance equal to deliveredQuantity minus plannedQuantity, calculated cost and energy, inventoryMovements, and updated lotFeedTotals.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client sends POST /feeding-events.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-8\",\n  \"given\": \"A client has a valid bearer token, an existing feeding event, known opening stock for its affected inventory items, and persisted receipts, adjustments, or other feeding events affecting those items, and either a valid correction request or an event